{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>本年度《2026香港小姐競選》今日（2日）在電視城舉行首輪面試，有份獲邀參加首輪面試的參選佳麗於早上到達電視城，今年港姐競選以「敢·至完美」為主題。多位參賽佳麗雲集，當中不乏打扮性感、身材出眾的高質靚女，但亦有不少以另類個性打扮突圍而出！</p><p>攝：葉志明、陳順禎、林迅景、陳釗</p><figure><img alt=\"去年有參選的Gigi今年再接再厲。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138434036696485888103629.jpeg/auZiKZRNN-8oxyje4dRjWy-XYF7fgADO4sXqbOLF6mw\"/><figcaption>去年有參選的Gigi今年再接再厲。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Gigi指去年被改了有趣花名「Labubu」，今年以紅髮美人魚造型亮相。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138434034062331904371890.jpeg/wCfpESYOn8VCEV8DE6rxMlTpeL_EFJSFswHkz7MB5M8\"/><figcaption>Gigi指去年被改了有趣花名「Labubu」，今年以紅髮美人魚造型亮相。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Crystal以T恤牛仔褲現身。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430459622199296094752.jpeg/EjbZ5pkT23gMn3tRQxmKEJJTx_Cpdj1KHfSKMx30ijM\"/><figcaption>Crystal以T恤牛仔褲現身。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"原來係古箏老師。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430457239703552781259.jpeg/Pj3jUQy9XUtGk4Kq9hfmoeyixQ1EGmhjxB8SUsQfElI\"/><figcaption>原來係古箏老師。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"打扮非常悠閒低調。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430454920122368608593.jpeg/-Vn1jLQ6TRwNMKWeornYiWktJyPLywIoxAv5_cQL-f0\"/><figcaption>打扮非常悠閒低調。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擁有健康膚色的姜文萱以超貼身白色裙示人。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138432730510397440684035.jpeg/0VjRdTpewz1TycClI0L3NxeKBBt21VC16FqApOhagKQ\"/><figcaption>擁有健康膚色的姜文萱以超貼身白色裙示人。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"來自內蒙古的佳麗。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430464055840768649053.jpeg/JmkLBZzYONZpwNxzp5yuilyVcgpGzKAmGTvD-Bk7w_g\"/><figcaption>來自內蒙古的佳麗。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"特別揀選黃色長裙，原來在家鄉是代表吉祥的顏色，保佑自己能夠入圍。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430461891448832947625.jpeg/AXz3lZ7K1Pr4uPDLcfwnQFAuq28wIYhUZJWIbGSViGw\"/><figcaption>特別揀選黃色長裙，原來在家鄉是代表吉祥的顏色，保佑自己能夠入圍。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在鄭州讀大學的何小姐以全黑造型來面試。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138434039078981632047231.jpeg/mjCR1AbSSyX3C8fvWLta6BQt4TF1fHdEBxRFbAcURWw\"/><figcaption>在鄭州讀大學的何小姐以全黑造型來面試。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"25歲的仲笑蝶（Delia）。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138439438846791680458710.jpeg/e1-THZlDPD6iUbowxIpuLmaOwGhxgcSJe7heEHu4XhA\"/><figcaption>25歲的仲笑蝶（Delia）。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"仲笑蝶由父親陪伴下來面試，父親為深圳人，任職心理諮詢師，大讚女兒由細到大都好優秀。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138439835430686720943067.jpeg/bAaBjs5E0RbZY9ZUPnS5CuIm_Achp2gd71HPxO9Rz8Q\"/><figcaption>仲笑蝶由父親陪伴下來面試，父親為深圳人，任職心理諮詢師，大讚女兒由細到大都好優秀。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"24歲的張婷婷。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138439436506238976486902.jpeg/Pmpl0nhEBfd7MpAlUX5EVaDALc3csPTD8yPtafMj7Wk\"/><figcaption>24歲的張婷婷。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T03:58:42.028658+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":378,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}